# Screenplay adaptation projects: copyrighted source, drafts and generated scripts stay local
agents/*/adaptations/
agents/*/adaptation.json
agents/*/briefs.md
agents/*/screenplay.json
agents/*/screenplay.fountain
agents/*/screenplay.md
